// Trajectory projection and comparison (protocol/trajectory.ts, adapters/pi/trajectory.ts,
// runtime/contracts/trajectory.ts, cli/trajectory.ts). Self-contained: every input is a committed fixture loaded into
// a scratch durable store and read back through the read-only CLI path. No Pi, network or key is used.
//
// - REAL Pi 1.0.1 recordings (research/pi-conformance/1.0.1/lifecycle/): each against itself, completes vs
//   stop-mid-turn, and killed-and-resumed.
// - FAKE hostile recordings (tests/fixtures/trajectory/fake-pi/, regenerated by record-fake.ts beside them): each
//   differs from `baseline` in one controlled way. Every comparison's digest is pinned here.
// - Keyed argument digests and the comparison-domain key file (runtime/contracts/keyed-digest.ts,
//   storage/digest-key.ts).
